OL,3,AChris Mason: Burnham and Swinney tussle
OL,4,Aover where power lies in Scotland
OL,5,
OL,6,FNext year will mark the moment the
OL,7,Fparty has been in devolved power at
OL,8,FHolyrood for 20 years.
